# Analects Book 15 (衛靈公) — draft, first part: lemmata 0–29 = passages 15.1–15.17 (UNITS_A[0] is lemma 0).
# Token format as the pilot:
#   tokens separated by " | "; a token is  CHARS[PUNCT][=pinyin][/context gloss[//char gloss//char gloss]]
#   a leading "^" breaks the verse line before the token.
# Punctuation is editorial (the edition has none) and always trails the word before it.
# Pinyin defaults to the glossary's first reading; every polyphone states its reading here, and so does
# every bound compound and every character not yet in the glossary (on every occurrence).
# Passages follow Zhu Xi's chapter breaks (凡四十一章): 15.1 = units 0–2, 15.2 = 3–5, 15.3 = 6, 15.4 = 7,
# 15.5 = 8–11, 15.6 = 12–13, 15.7 = 14, 15.8 = 15, 15.9 = 16, 15.10 = 17–22, 15.11 = 23, 15.12 = 24,
# 15.13 = 25, 15.14 = 26, 15.15 = 27, 15.16 = 28, 15.17 = 29. Each stretch holds one chapter (no npas).
# Ruan 1816 splits our 15.1 at 在陳絶糧, so its numbers run one ahead from there; we use Zhu Xi's.
# Cross-references cite the shipped passage numbers (Zhu Xi's chapters, as the cards show them).
# Quotation marks balance within every unit. Where a speech runs on past one of Zhu Xi's comments (15.5 unit
# 10 after 9; 15.6 unit 13 after 12; 15.10 units 19–22 after 18) the continuation is left unquoted, Chinese
# and English alike (as Books 8–14). Quote inside a quote: 『』 in w, ‘’ in l and i (27).
# Repeats (shipped English reused): 一以貫之 'one thing strings it through' (5; as 4.15); 邦有道 / 邦無道 'when
#   the state had the Way / lacked the Way' (12, 13; as 5.20, 8.13, 14.1, 14.4); 君子哉 + name 'A gentleman
#   indeed, …!' (13; as 5.2, 14.6); 已矣乎 'It is finished!' (24; as 5.26 巳矣乎); 吾未見好徳如好色者也 (24; = 9.17,
#   l and i reused); 吾末如之何也已矣 'with him I have no way of doing anything, and that is all' (27; = 9.23);
#   韶 'the Shao' (21; 3.25, 7.13); 南面 'face south' unbound (7; as 6.1); 為邦 'governing a state' (17; 13.11).
# Misprint (emend.json, analects-15 unit 7): the print has 恭已 in lemma 7; w reads 恭己 and the note opens
#   with the correction. The final 而已矣 stays 已.
# Readings decided (Zhu Xi's marks in brackets):
#   陳 zhèn (0, 'battle array' = 陣; 陳去聲), chén (1, the state); 嘗 cháng (0); 行 xíng throughout (0 'set off';
#   8, 9 ×2 行矣 / 行乎哉, 10 'get through'; 9 ×2 'conduct' — Zhu Xi 行篤行不之行去聲, xìng, modern xíng, noted;
#   18 'use'; 28 'practise'; 29 'carry out'); 従 cóng (1; 従去聲, zòng, modern cóng, noted as 11.2); 興 xīng (1);
#   見 xiàn (2, 'came before him'; 賢遍反), jiàn (10 ×2, 24); 女 rǔ (3; 音汝); 予 yú (3, 5); 識 zhì (3; 音志);
#   與 yú (3, 4; 平聲, 下同), yú (7; 平聲), yǔ (14 ×4 'with'), yú (25 者與; 平聲), yǔ (25 與立 'stand with');
#   為 wéi throughout (3, 7 ×2, 16, 17, 29); 由 yóu (6); 知 zhī (6, 25), zhì (14; 知去聲); 鮮 xiǎn (6; 上聲);
#   夫 fú (7, 10; 音扶); 治 zhì (7); 已 yǐ (7, 24, 27); 道 dào (12 ×2, 13 ×2); 參 cān (10; 七南反); 貊 mò (9; 亡百反);
#   殺 shā (15); 乘 chéng (19; 'ride'); 輅 lù (19; 音路); 樂 yuè (21); 逺 yuǎn (22 'keep far away' and 26 'keep
#   far off' — Zhu Xi 逺去聲, yuàn, modern yuǎn, noted at 22 and 26; 23 adjective, no mark); 好 hào (24 ×2, 28;
#   去聲); 末 mò (27); 難 nán (28); 孫 xùn (29; 去聲, = 遜); 巻 juǎn (13).
# Glyphs kept as printed: 絶 (1), 従 (1), 德 (6; the edition prints 德 here and 徳 at 24), 巻 (13), 顔 (17),
#   逺 (22, 23, 26), 徳 (24), 栁 (25), 羣 (28).
# Bound (keys exist): 衛靈公, 孔子, 子路, 君子, 小人, 子張, 蘧伯玉, 子貢, 大夫, 顔淵, 臧文仲, 如之何.
# New bound keys needed (names; pinyin as stated):
#   史魚 (shǐ yú — Shi Yu, 'the archivist Yu': Shi Qiu 史鰌, a grandee of Wei; Zhu Xi 史官名，魚衛大夫名鰌; Kong
#     Anguo 衛大夫史鰌)
#   栁下惠 (liǔ xià huì — Liuxia Hui: Zhan Huo 展獲, courtesy name Qin 禽, grandee of Lu; Liuxia his fief, Hui
